  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "一切由部门承担  (The Department Takes Responsibility)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "stella": "斯戴拉",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "DTS network sends a supervisor to Xingtian to demand accountability for last week's broadcast accident, and Stella tries to pin the blame on an intern until Chun Yuqiao speaks up. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这个问题我们不是在上次的摔杯子会议上就已经解决了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我们还得在这儿特别正式地感谢一下您。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "非常感谢您那天没把那个杯子往我们脸上摔。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "这次不是公关体系漏洞。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "问题出现在一个实习制片身上，是个案。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "制作一部没有个案，一切都由部门承担。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "那我收回刚才的言论。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "想要怎么交代，我任意奉陪。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "制作一部都是高级员工，没有实习生。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "责任必须到人的话，人不是在你面前吗？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这个问题我们不是在上次的摔杯子会议上就已经解决了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did we not already settle this issue at the cup-smashing meeting last time?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我们还得在这儿特别正式地感谢一下您。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We also ought to thank you very formally right here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "非常感谢您那天没把那个杯子往我们脸上摔。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you very much for not throwing that cup at our faces the other day.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "这次不是公关体系漏洞。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This incident was not a flaw in our public-relations system.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "问题出现在一个实习制片身上，是个案。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The problem came from one intern producer; it was an isolated case.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "制作一部没有个案，一切都由部门承担。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Unit One has no isolated cases; the department bears responsibility for everything.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "那我收回刚才的言论。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then I withdraw my remark just now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "想要怎么交代，我任意奉陪。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Whatever accounting you want, I am ready to answer for it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "制作一部都是高级员工，没有实习生。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone in Unit One is a senior staff member; there are no interns.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "责任必须到人的话，人不是在你面前吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If responsibility must fall on one person, is that person not standing right before you?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这个问题我们不是在上次的摔杯子会议上就已经解决了吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我们还得在这儿特别正式地感谢一下您。",
      "gap": 0.5
